msgid "If attached to CL2/DA2, set :ref:`ARSPD_BUS<ARSPD_BUS>` = 0, as well as appropriate :ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wse.rst:130
